  "solution": {
    "text": "as&nbsp;<math><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">vdv</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">ds</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4s</mn></msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4s</mn></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi></math><br />which is constant so we can use equation of motion now Squaring the given equation, we get<br /><br />v<sup>2</sup> = 4 + 4s<br /><br />Now, comparing it with&nbsp;&nbsp;v<sup>2</sup> = u<sup>2</sup> + 2as<br /><br />we get, &nbsp;&nbsp; u = 2 m/s and a = 2 m/s<sup>2</sup><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>∴</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Displacement at t = 2s &nbsp;&nbsp;is<br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>s</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mtext>ut</mtext> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <msup> <mtext>at</mtext> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mtext>s</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>+</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <msup> <mrow> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;s = 8 m",
